{
  "id": "EUVD-2026-124331",
  "enisaUuid": "90044be7-5bb5-3528-a01b-d5f3e3abf55d",
  "description": "A vulnerability in the administration REST interface of Azul Payara allows a remote, unauthenticated attacker to bypass secure-admin remote-access restrictions by supplying an arbitrary value in the X-GlassFish-authToken HTTP header. The header's presence waives the remote-rejection check before the token is validated, and an invalid token falls through to password-based authentication, which succeeds without credentials on default domains configured with an empty administrative password. Successful exploitation grants execution of arbitrary administrative commands, equivalent to complete compromise of the server.",
  "datePublished": "Nov 12, 2026, 9:32:51 AM",
